<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Verify Your Email</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #1e40af);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 1rem;
        }

        .verify-card {
            background: #fff;
            max-width: 420px;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 1.2rem;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            animation: fadeIn 0.7s ease;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(20px);
            }

            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .icon {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #1e40af;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
        }

        p {
            color: #555;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .email {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #2563eb;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.4rem;
            background: #2563eb;
            color: #fff;
            border-radius: 0.6rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background: #1e40af;
        }

        .resend {
            margin-top: 1.2rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .resend a {
            color: #2563eb;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .resend a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="verify-card">
        <div class="icon">📧</div>
        <h2>We sent a link to your Email</h2>
        <p>
            We’ve sent a verification link to
            <span class="email">your Gmail address</span>.
            <br />
            Please click the link in your MAIL to activate your account.
        </p>

        <a href="/signup" target="_blank" class="btn">Try Again</a>


    </div>
</body>

</html>